  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2906.04 Authorized Account Representative.\n\n(a) Each holder of a compliance account, overdraft account, or general account shall designate one individual to be the AAR for the account and one individual to be the alternate AAR for the account.\n\n(b) The alternate AAR shall have the same authority to initiate allowance transfers and file reports as the AAR.\n\nSource. #7888, eff 5-13-03; ss by #9908, INTERIM, eff 5-13-11, EXPIRES: 11-9-11; ss by #10002, eff 10-1-11 (from Env-A 2909.04); ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
